WEBVTT

00:03:29.664 --> 00:03:34.085
an online platform where we hope
to ensure that every queer African,

00:03:34.126 --> 00:03:36.712
both on the African continent
and in the diaspora,

00:03:36.754 --> 00:03:39.090
has access to the resources they need,

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.884
like verified opportunities, mentorship,

00:03:41.926 --> 00:03:43.844
fundraising and safety.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.388
Over the years,

00:03:45.429 --> 00:03:48.891
we've learned a lot about how to build
a safe online community.

00:03:48.891 --> 00:03:51.477
And I want to share
those learnings with you today.

00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:54.188
The first key is community vetting.

00:03:54.689 --> 00:03:58.693
Any safe online space has to find
a way to keep out the bots,

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:00.486
the trolls and the blackmailers.